# The pcfactory agent's id and a publishable key for it whose allowed origins
# are https://www.pcfactory.cl and https://pcfactory.cl (the host pages:
# content.js runs in the page's world, so its fetch carries the page's Origin).
# Neither is committed: this repo is public.
VOQALIZE_AGENT_ID=
VOQALIZE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# The control plane the widget mints its session against. Dev by default.
VOQALIZE_API_BASE=https://app.dev.voqalize.com/api/v1
